    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Aquila Kill Team",
    "summary": "Whenever this unit is the target of an attack and its models have differing T characteristics, the roll needed to wound uses the T that most of its models have, until the attacking models finish their attacks; if there is a tie for the majority, take the highest of the tied values. When checking which models of this unit fit inside a TRANSPORT, each Gravis Veteran model counts as 2 models for space, but may otherwise ride in any TRANSPORT its unit is allowed to embark within, despite comparable models in other units carrying the GRAVIS keyword.",
